displayDefinitions:
- F_0=\sum_{i=0}^{2}(X_i^6+Y_i^6)
- Q_i=X_i^2+Y_i^2,\quad i=0,1,2
- H_i=\ell_i^3\cdot n_i+m_i^3\cdot o_i+\ell_i^2\cdot o_i^2
- \ell_i=\frac17\cdot\sum_{j=0}^2(j+i+1)\cdot X_j
- m_i=\frac1{11}\cdot\sum_{j=0}^2(2\cdot j+i+1)\cdot Y_j
- n_i=\frac1{13}\cdot\sum_{j=0}^2(j+1)^{i+1}\cdot X_j
- o_i=\frac1{17}\cdot\sum_{j=0}^2(j+2)^{i+1}\cdot Y_j
- (p_0,p_1,p_2)=(7,11,13)
